               <code>
                  <coding>
                     <system value="http://loinc.org"/>
                     <code value="8648-8"/>
                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your 21-year-old female patient admitted on 08/09/2021 with confirmed SARS-CoV-2 infection. Upon admission, she presented with fever, dry cough, dyspnoea, and fatigue. Chest X-ray and CT thorax confirmed bilateral COVID-19 pneumonia. Blood tests, arterial blood gas analysis, and continuous pulse oximetry were performed to monitor her respiratory status. Oxygen supplementation was initiated due to hypoxaemia. She received antiviral and anti-inflammatory pharmacotherapy, including dexamethasone, alongside supportive intravenous fluid replacement. Physiotherapy was initiated to support respiratory recovery. Clinical improvement was observed over the following days, with normalisation of oxygen saturation on room air. She is discharged in a recovering condition with outpatient follow-up recommended. Please ensure continued monitoring of respiratory function and general recovery. Do not hesitate to contact me for further information.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
